  /* ============ THE FREE GIFT LINE'S PRICE CELL, OWNED OUTRIGHT ============
     Borrowing .nc-lsave meant depending on nc-cro building it, pg-chips filling
     it, and pg-drawer's :has() rules agreeing about it -- three owners for one
